flowchart TD
    Start([User Opens App]) --> S1[State 1: Input Dashboard]
    S1 -->|User submits query| Guard[Abstention Guardrail Check]
    Guard -->|REJECTED: out-of-scope or low confidence| Err[Error: Query Rejected - reason shown]
    Err -->|Return to input| S1
    Guard -->|ACCEPTED: proceed| Split((Fork))

    subgraph Parallel["Parallel Backend Execution"]
        direction LR
        TrackA[Track A: Sidd's Formulation Classifier Logic]
        TrackB[Track B: Krish's Hybrid RAG Retriever]
    end

    Split --> TrackA
    Split --> TrackB
    TrackA --> Merge((Join))
    TrackB --> Merge
    Merge --> S2[State 2 and 3: Dynamic Results and Verdict Dashboard]

    S2 -->|User flips jurisdiction control| JT[Jurisdiction Toggle: India to International]
    JT -->|Switch to International| UpdateUI[Update local UI state: re-render verdict, treaty notes, intl citations]
    UpdateUI --> S2
    JT -->|Switch to India default| S2

    S2 -->|User selects a citation| S4[State 4: Citation Vault]
    S4 --> Term([Terminal: span-level citation text, source metadata, jurisdiction-tagged links])

    classDef screenState fill:#FFA94D,stroke:#8a5a00,stroke-width:2px,color:#1a1a1a
    classDef backendLogic fill:#51cf66,stroke:#2b8a3e,stroke-width:2px,color:#0b2e13
    classDef errorPath fill:#ff6b6b,stroke:#a61e1e,stroke-width:2px,color:#3a0000

    class S1,S2,S4,JT,UpdateUI screenState
    class Guard,TrackA,TrackB backendLogic
    class Err errorPath
